OL,3,GNEWSAData breach caused staff
OL,4,A'significant distress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large data breach at a hospital trust
OL,7,Fled to staff experiencing "significant
OL,8,Fdistress, loss of trust and ongoing
OL,9,Fanxiety", a meeting has heard.
OL,11,FThe Royal Cornwall Hospitals NHS Trust
OL,12,Fbreach exposed personal health
OL,13,Finformation relating to almost 8,000
OL,14,Fcurrent and former staff.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
