OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAData breach caused staff
OL,4,A'significant distress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spreadsheet published in February
OL,7,F2023 exposed hidden sickness absence
OL,8,Fdata, including sensitive health
OL,9,Finformation, relating to 7,715 trust
OL,10,Fstaff and 288 non-trust workers, with
OL,11,Fthe information having remained
OL,12,Fpublicly available until November 2025,
OL,13,Fthe trust board meeting heard.
OL,15,FAn independent investigation identified
OL,16,Fweaknesses across many areas. Hospital
OL,17,Fbosses apologised and said it should
OL,18,Fnever have happened.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
